  "body": "[subscribeToChanges()](https://wicg.github.io/cookie-store/#dom-cookiestore-subscribetochanges) is now defined but the actual mechanism to observe changes and generate events doesn't even exist in the spec. \r\n\r\nThis needs to:\r\n* Monkey patch [RFC6265bis's 5.4 Storage Model](https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-ietf-httpbis-rfc6265bis-02#section-5.4) to capture the before/after state and produce a diff\r\n* Enumerate subscribers\r\n* Mint and fire the events\r\n \r\n",
